OL,3,APolice treating 'targeted' shooting of
OL,4,Awoman as attempted murder
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice are treating the shooting of a
OL,7,Fwoman in Glasgow on Monday night as
OL,8,Fattempted murder.
OL,10,FThe 27-year-old was taken to hospital
OL,11,Fafter emergency services were called to
OL,12,FEynort Street in the city's Lambhill
OL,13,Farea at about 23:45.
OL,15,FThe victim suffered serious injuries
OL,16,Fand is in hospital, where she is in a
OL,17,Fcritical but stable condition.
OL,19,FPolice Scotland described the attack as
OL,20,Fbeing "an extremely reckless act with
OL,21,Fno regard for the safety of the local
OL,22,Fcommunity".
OL,23,APub: 18-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
